stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Draft : Compiled by AI Orchestrator
    Draft --> Validating : evt_policy_validation_started
    
    Validating --> Ready : evt_policy_passed [Policy engine positive check]
    Validating --> Rejected : evt_policy_failed / timeout (3 sec fail-closed)
    
    Ready --> Released : evt_recommendation_released [Confidence threshold met]
    
    Released --> Accepted : dec_recommendation_approved [Supervisor click]
    Released --> Rejected : dec_recommendation_rejected / decision override
